    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: checking a news story",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "关于「连贯段落」的消息传播很快，但传播速度不等于准确。",
       "alumno": "News about «cohesive paragraphs» can spread quickly, but speed doesn't mean accuracy.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "判断消息是否可靠时，应核实原始来源，并比较独立报道。",
       "alumno": "To judge whether a report is reliable, check the original source and compare independent coverage.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "不同来源有时会强调问题的不同方面，比较它们有助于发现遗漏。",
       "alumno": "Sometimes different sources stress different aspects of a problem; comparing them helps to spot what is missing.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "写作时要解释这些材料如何支持主要观点。",
       "alumno": "When writing, explain how these materials support the main idea.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
